{
  "schemaVersion": 1,
  "id": "behind-the-scenes-s01e05-scene-13",
  "pair": "zh-en",
  "title": "二十几个问题  (Twenty-Something Questions for Chun Yuqiao)",
  "level": "A1 — beginner",
  "labels": {
    "bu_xiaogu": "布小谷",
    "xingzi": "杏子",
    "chun_yuqiao": "淳于乔"
  },
  "segments": [
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "After Xingzi updates Chun Yuqiao on the red-carpet commentators, Bu Xiaogu works up the courage to ask Yuqiao for production guidance and brings back more than twenty tough questions from her meeting. Listen to the Mandarin first.",
      "gap": 0.8
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "淳于总，早上好！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "xingzi",
      "t": "老大，早！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "萧尧和吕怡那边怎么样了？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "xingzi",
      "t": "昨天说服他们俩了，他们都答应在节目上公开道歉，邓主任挺满意的。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "在节目上找麻烦，又上节目来道歉，是在打如意算盘吗？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "淳于总，我知道我是从行政借调过来的。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "可是我是真的很想学习节目制作。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "如果我有问题，可以问您吗？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "那我现在就有问题，可以吗？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "策划有哪些点不满意，你提出来，我们改进。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "淳于总，早！我有二十几个问题想要请教您，可以吗？",
      "gap": 0.9
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Now let's go through it line by line with the English translation.",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "淳于总，早上好！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Good morning, Mr Chun Yuqiao!'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "xingzi",
      "t": "老大，早！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Morning, boss!'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "萧尧和吕怡那边怎么样了？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'How are things going with Xiao Yao and Lv Yi?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "xingzi",
      "t": "昨天说服他们俩了，他们都答应在节目上公开道歉，邓主任挺满意的。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'I convinced them both yesterday to apologise publicly on the show, and Director Deng is pleased.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "在节目上找麻烦，又上节目来道歉，是在打如意算盘吗？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Causing trouble on air and coming back on air to apologise — is that their clever little scheme?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "淳于总，我知道我是从行政借调过来的。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Mr Chun Yuqiao, I know I was seconded over from administration.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "可是我是真的很想学习节目制作。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Yet I truly want to learn television programme production.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "如果我有问题，可以问您吗？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'If I have questions, may I ask you?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "那我现在就有问题，可以吗？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Then I already have a question right now, is that alright?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "策划有哪些点不满意，你提出来，我们改进。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Whichever parts of the proposal fall short, point them out and we will improve them.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "淳于总，早！我有二十几个问题想要请教您，可以吗？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Morning, Mr Chun Yuqiao! I have over twenty questions to ask your advice on, may I?'",
      "gap": 0.65
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Now let's listen to the whole conversation one last time.",
      "gap": 0.75
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "淳于总，早上好！",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "xingzi",
      "t": "老大，早！",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "萧尧和吕怡那边怎么样了？",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "xingzi",
      "t": "昨天说服他们俩了，他们都答应在节目上公开道歉，邓主任挺满意的。",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "在节目上找麻烦，又上节目来道歉，是在打如意算盘吗？",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "淳于总，我知道我是从行政借调过来的。",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "可是我是真的很想学习节目制作。",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "如果我有问题，可以问您吗？",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "那我现在就有问题，可以吗？",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "策划有哪些点不满意，你提出来，我们改进。",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "淳于总，早！我有二十几个问题想要请教您，可以吗？",
      "gap": 0.9
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Without knowing who raised those twenty-something questions, Yuqiao begins coaching Xiaogu through every detail of show design. See you next time!",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "明天见！",
      "gap": 0.3
    }
  ],
